  "description": "The **web** service is built from the\u202f`./web`\u202fdirectory using the Dockerfile named\u202f`Dockerfile`, and it starts with the command\u202f`npm start`. It runs in a container called\u202f`my_web` with a CPU share of\u202f512 and is confined to CPUs\u202f0\u20111. The container has the sound device\u202f`/dev/snd` attached, uses DNS servers\u202f`8.8.8.8`\u202fand\u202f`8.8.4.4`\u202fand searches the domain\u202f`example.com`. Its domain name and hostname are both set to\u202f`example.com`\u202fand\u202f`webhost` respectively, and it uses the entrypoint script\u202f`/entrypoint.sh`. Environment configuration is supplied via the\u202f`.env`\u202ffile together with explicit variables:\u202f`NODE_ENV=production`,\u202f`PORT=3000`, and\u202f`DEBUG=false`. The service exposes internal port\u202f3000 and extends the\u202f`base`\u202fservice defined in\u202f`docker-compose.base.yml`. An extra host mapping of\u202f`host.docker.internal=host-gateway`\u202fis added, and it links externally to a Redis container via\u202f`redis:redis`. The image used is\u202f`node:14\u2011alpine`; IPC mode is set to\u202f`shareable` and the MAC address is\u202f`02:42:ac:11:00:02`. Labels applied are\u202f`traefik.enable=true`\u202fand\u202f`com.example.description=Web service`. It also links to the\u202f`db`\u202fservice, logs with the\u202f`json\u2011file`\u202fdriver (max size\u202f10\u202fMB, max files\u202f3), and has a memory limit of\u202f`512m`\u202fwith a swap limit of\u202f`1g`. The service is identified as\u202f`web_service`, attached to the\u202f`frontend`\u202fnetwork, and leaves the PID setting unspecified. Port mappings expose HTTP and HTTPS on\u202f`80:80`\u202fand\u202f`443:443`. The container runs non\u2011privileged, is not read\u2011only, restarts\u202f`always`, and applies the security option\u202f`no-new-privileges`. Interactive stdin is open, a TTY is allocated, the process runs as user\u202f`node`, and its working directory is\u202f`/app`. Two volume mounts are defined:\u202f`./src:/app/src`\u202fand\u202f`./logs:/app/logs`, using the\u202f`local`\u202fvolume driver, and it also inherits volumes from\u202f`data_volume`.\n\nThe **db** service uses the\u202f`postgres:13`\u202fimage and runs in a container named\u202f`my_db`. Its environment is supplied as a list:\u202f`POSTGRES_USER=admin`,\u202f`POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secret`, and\u202f`POSTGRES_DB=appdb`. The service maps port\u202f`5432:5432`\u202fto the host and mounts a persistent volume at\u202f`/var/lib/postgresql/data:/var/lib/postgresql/data`. It is set to restart\u202f`unless\u2011stopped`, connects to the\u202f`backend`\u202fnetwork, and has the hostname\u202f`dbhost`. A label identifies its role as\u202f`com.example.role=database`. The container runs without privileged mode, does not keep stdin open, and does not allocate a TTY.",
  "reference_json": {
    "web": {
      "build": "./web",
      "dockerfile": "Dockerfile",
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "start"
      ],
      "container_name": "my_web",
      "cpu_shares": 512,
      "cpuset": "0-1",
      "devices": [
        "/dev/snd"
      ],
      "dns": [
        "8.8.8.8",
        "8.8.4.4"
      ],
      "dns_search": "example.com",
      "domainname": "example.com",
      "entrypoint": "/entrypoint.sh",
      "env_file": ".env",
      "environment": {
        "NODE_ENV": "production",
        "PORT": 3000,
        "DEBUG": false
      },
      "expose": [
        3000
      ],
      "extends": {
        "service": "base",
        "file": "docker-compose.base.yml"
      },
      "extra_hosts": {
        "host.docker.internal": "host-gateway"
      },
      "external_links": [
        "redis:redis"
      ],
      "hostname": "webhost",
      "image": "node:14-alpine",
      "ipc": "shareable",
      "labels": [
        "traefik.enable=true",
        "com.example.description=Web service"
      ],
      "links": [
        "db"
      ],
      "log_driver": "json-file",
      "log_opt": {
        "max-size": "10m",
        "max-file": "3"
      },
      "mac_address": "02:42:ac:11:00:02",
      "mem_limit": "512m",
      "memswap_limit": "1g",
      "name": "web_service",
      "net": "frontend",
      "pid": null,
      "ports": [
        "80:80",
        "443:443"
      ],
      "privileged": false,
      "read_only": false,
      "restart": "always",
      "security_opt": [
        "no-new-privileges"
      ],
      "stdin_open": true,
      "tty": true,
      "user": "node",
      "volumes": [
        "./src:/app/src",
        "./logs:/app/logs"
      ],
      "volume_driver": "local",
      "volumes_from": [
        "data_volume"
      ],
      "working_dir": "/app"
    },
    "db": {
      "image": "postgres:13",
      "container_name": "my_db",
      "environment": [
        "POSTGRES_USER=admin",
        "POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secret",
        "POSTGRES_DB=appdb"
      ],
      "ports": [
        "5432:5432"
      ],
      "volumes": [
        "/var/lib/postgresql/data:/var/lib/postgresql/data"
      ],
      "restart": "unless-stopped",
      "net": "backend",
      "hostname": "dbhost",
      "labels": {
        "com.example.role": "database"
      },
      "privileged": false,
      "stdin_open": false,
      "tty": false
    }
  }
}